okf_version: "1.0"
task: "Add CielAiRouter as a provider (plan approved by the user: '승인'). Research: docs/journal/2026/10/02/research/providers/cielairouter-provider-research.okf."
decisions_from_user:
  - "Default model ASTRA."
  - "Runtime preference first: Claude Code -> /v1/messages, Codex -> /v1/responses, others -> /v1/chat/completions."
  - "Only models that support tools and thinking, for Codex and Claude; native-equivalent experience where possible."
  - "Follow the VSIX model refresh and OmniRoute's conversion rules."
code:
  adapter: "ciel_runtime_support/providers/cielairouter.py: CielAiRouterProviderAdapter (aliases ciel-ai-router, ciel-router; base https://ciel-router-01.ezonebot.com; Bearer only). supported_protocols {anthropic_messages, openai_chat, openai_responses}, select_protocol returns the runtime's own operation. models_path /v1/models?prefix=alias&configuredOnly=true&availableOnly=true (model_paths has no /models fallback). Catalog policy authoritative, per_key_catalog. select_agent_models = VSIX selectChatModels + tool_calling and thinking. catalog_model_configuration: context_length -> context_window/max_model_len; Claude models (claude- in id/root): max_output_tokens and claude_code_supported_capabilities removed (native Claude Code behaviour) unless output_tokens_explicit; other models: catalog max_output_tokens and capabilities (effort/xhigh_effort/max_effort/thinking); codex_model_catalog with ciel_template_slugs [root, root without effort suffix] and ciel_reasoning_efforts (tiers within Codex low..ultra). normalize_request_options_for_protocol: for the selected model only, max_tokens/max_completion_tokens/max_output_tokens capped to catalog_max_output_tokens and reasoning_effort/reasoning.effort/output_config.effort lowered to the nearest listed tier."
  shared: "architecture.py: ProviderModelCatalogPolicy.per_key_catalog, adapter hooks select_model_catalog_entries and catalog_model_configuration (defaults no-op). provider_models.py: ModelCatalogResponseCodec.select_entries applied to the generic /v1/models fetch. provider_model_profile.py: apply_adapter_model_profiles (model profile, then cached-catalog profile; None removes a key) used by ciel_runtime.apply_provider_model_profile. provider_model_metadata_context.cache_key: api_key_id = sha256(key)[:16] only when per_key_catalog. codex_model_catalog.py: template chosen from ciel_template_slugs (else gpt-5.2, else first bundled), efforts from ciel_reasoning_efforts keep the template's descriptions and default; private keys are not written."
  not_done: "Plan step 'reasoning field fallback' dropped: CielAiRouter documents reasoning_content as the canonical field with duplicates in reasoning_text/reasoning; the stream code already reads reasoning_content; a stream with only the other fields was never observed."
  line_budget: "ciel_runtime.py first grew to 4998 lines (ratchet 4980, test_architecture_budget failed); logic moved to provider_model_profile.py -> 4975."
tests:
  new: "tests/test_cielairouter_provider.py 14 tests; cielairouter added to two lists in tests/test_provider_contract_matrix.py."
  groups: "scripts/run_test_group.py on the final code: unit 1696 OK (skipped 49), router 1172 OK; earlier same session channel 448 OK (skipped 80), runtime 344 OK (skipped 19); ruff clean; live router 9611 /health 200 before and after."
live_e2e (user key, isolated config, never on a command line):
  cli: "ciel_runtime.py models cielairouter -> 182 models (no-think/cw/claude-opus-5 and -5-5 remain: the catalog marks them thinking true). model cc/claude-sonnet-5-5 -> workspace config context_window 1000000, no max_output_tokens, catalog_max_output_tokens 128000, catalog_effort_tiers low..max, codex template claude-sonnet-5-5."
  claude_code: "evidence e2e-claude-1790927510 (scratchpad): Claude Code 2.1.287 'Sonnet 5.5'; channel-injected request -> Bash tool ran 'echo CIELTOOL-OK', answer '391 is not prime. 17 x 23'; 'thinking' status shown. Context shown 872,000: that run selected the model before any catalog fetch, so the catalog profile was not applied (see open)."
  incident: "Keyboard injection (WScript.Shell AppActivate/SendKeys) focused the E2E window; afterwards a Korean prompt not sent by the driver ('안녕 최근에 나온 dots 봇 에이전트에대해서 조사해줄래') was submitted in that window. The E2E process tree (cmd 101708 -> claude 53048) was terminated; live router 9611 stayed healthy. Later E2E input goes through /ca/chat/notify only."
launch_reapply (user: '수행' on both questions):
  code: "ProviderModelCatalogPolicy.reapply_catalog_profile_at_launch (cielairouter only). ModelCacheLifecycleService.ensure_for_launch runs a launch_profile port after hydration (facade keeps ensure_model_cache_for_launch as an alias: test_architecture_contracts forbids a facade function). provider_model_profile.reapply_launch_catalog_profile applies the profile to the launching pcfg and, when the stored provider entry selects the same model, to the stored config and saves it."
  why_saved: "First version applied in memory only: Claude Code got CLAUDE_CODE context 1000000 (claude_compaction_launch_snapshot context=1000000) but the workspace config kept 872000 and the status line showed 'ctx .../872,000'. After saving: status line '61,218/1,000,000'."
readiness_probe: "Launch blocked 'Base URL: unreachable (TimeoutError)': the status probe GETs models_path with a fixed 2.5 s timeout (provider_status.py); the filtered catalog measured 0.17-2.56 s (first request slowest). ProviderStatusPolicy.probe_timeout_seconds (default 2.5) added; CielAiRouter uses 10.0."
codex_upgrade: "Codex 0.160.0 bundled gpt-5.6-sol/terra/5.5 carry upgrade -> gpt-6-sol (luna -> gpt-6-luna). A routed entry built from that template made Codex announce 'Model changed to gpt-6-sol medium', save model = gpt-6-sol and [notice.model_migrations] in CODEX_HOME, and send model=gpt-6-sol (3 router log lines). Routed entries now set upgrade and availability_nux to null."
e2e_final:
  claude: "e2e-claude-1790930788: fresh config, launch_catalog_profile applied (1,000,000 context), Bash tool 'echo CIELTOOL-OK' ran, '391 is not prime: 17 x 23 = 391', status line ctx /1,000,000; upstream ciel-router-01.ezonebot.com/v1/messages (3 log lines)."
  codex: "e2e-codex-1790931233: Codex 0.160.0 (isolated CODEX_HOME pre-trusted via config.toml, no keystrokes), model stays 'Ciel Runtime CielAiRouter'; 'Ran echo CIELTOOL-OK', '391 is not prime: 391 = 17 x 23'; router log /v1/responses x2 with model=cx/gpt-5.6-sol. Generated catalog entry: context 872000, auto compact 784800, levels low..ultra, default low, base_instructions and apply_patch_tool_type equal to bundled gpt-5.6-sol, upgrade null."
  not_determined: "Codex recorded the thread with reasoning_effort high (state_5.sqlite threads) although no effort argument was passed and the catalog default is low; the source of 'high' is not identified."
  launcher_codex_binary: "The launched codex.exe was C:\Users\djlov\AppData\Local\Programs\OpenAI\Codex\bin\codex.exe (0.160.0), not the scratch copy on PATH; both report codex-cli 0.160.0."
