  push: "ac46dfa feat(providers) + ec852de journal [skip ci] pushed to nightly (295c50d..ec852de); the diff contains no part of the API key. The head commit's [skip ci] skipped the push workflows, so CI and npm publish were dispatched on nightly."
  ci: "run 36989809253 (workflow_dispatch, ec852de): success."
  npm_publish: "run 36989812488: failure, 'npm error 404 Not Found - PUT https://registry.npmjs.org/@oneciel-ai%2fciel-runtime' for 0.2.51-nightly.20261002-092927.ec852de (same E404 since 2026-09-27; NPM_TOKEN renewal is the user's)."
  local: "GitHub tarball ec852de installed with install.ps1 (CIEL_RUNTIME_INSTALL_HOME=~/.local/share/ciel-runtime-ec852de6ffce4ee62d9550d7c6e3c4c1330e9d9e, PREFIX=~/.local, inherited CIEL_RUNTIME_* removed): user CIEL_RUNTIME_HOME 295c50d -> ec852de snapshot; the snapshot's 'provider list' includes cielairouter, 'version' prints ciel-runtime 0.2.51. Running sessions untouched; live router 9611 /health 200."
